[00:12.14]1. A paradise our God has promised,
[00:20.22]By means of Christ’s Millennial Reign,
[00:27.08]When he’ll blot out all sin and error,
[00:33.60]Removing death and tears and pain.
[00:39.84](Chorus)
[00:41.94]A paradise, the earth will be.
[00:46.60]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[00:51.90]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[00:59.46]For he delights to do God’s will.
[01:09.24]2. Soon here on earth, as God has purposed,
[01:09.34]His Son will cause the dead to rise.
[01:09.58]Then it will be as Jesus promised:
[01:09.58]‘You’ll be with me in Paradise.’
[01:35.64](Chorus)
[01:39.52]A paradise, the earth will be.
[01:43.32]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[01:48.58]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[01:56.18]For he delights to do God’s will.
[02:05.82]3. The Paradise, our Lord has promised,
[02:06.16]And he is now our reigning King.
[02:29.24]We daily thank our loving Father,
[02:35.48]And from our hearts, his praises sing.
[02:40.50](Chorus)
[02:43.16]A paradise, the earth will be.
[02:48.44]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[02:53.56]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[03:01.14]For he delights to do God’s will.
